@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape command
+
+Creates or refreshes a landscape report, aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+`analyzeLandscape` is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands; `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name and keeps working. Use `-help` after the command name for its options.
+
